        "quote": "CAPRI jointly optimizes model partition, edge or cloud server selection, edge-side computing and bandwidth allocation. In this way, CAPRI enables efficient collaboration among UAVs, edge servers, and the cloud, achieving a better latency–energy trade-off for multi-UAV inference services."
