          "page": 1,
          "quote": "2026 IEEE International Conference on Web Services (ICWS) | 979-8-3195-3769-0/26/$31.00 ©2026 IEEE | DOI: 10.1109/ICWS72778.2026.00067 Authorized licensed use limited to: Seoul National University. Downloaded on November 25,2026 at 01:42:27 UTC from IEEE Xplore."
