          "status": "YES",
          "rationale": "The entire 9-page conference paper is written in English.",
          "page": 1,
          "quote": "For UAV-enabled intelligent applications, e.g., urban monitoring, multi-UAV collaborative inference has becoming a popular paradigm of edge intelligence service. However, dynamic UAV states and unexpected failures may lead to service imbalance and disruption."
        }
