      "primary_reason": "Unresolved date_window gate: the supplied report provides only year 2026 (2026 IEEE ICWS) and a 2026-11-25 01:42:27 UTC IEEE Xplore download watermark without a dated publication record before the 2026-11-25 cutoff, preventing inclusion.",
