        "english": {
          "status": "YES",
          "rationale": "The full 15-page IEEE Access article is written in English.",
          "page": 1,
          "quote": "Distributed inference enabled via swarms of collaborative UAVs presents a promising solution by partitioning tasks among UAVs based on their available resources, allowing for more efficient, collaborative processing."
